  "title": "SentinelOne Named Pax8’s Partner’s Most Valuable Vendor in EMEA at Beyond 2026",
  "summary": "SentinelOne® (NYSE: S), the AI Security leader, today announced it has received a Pax8 Beyond Partner’s Most Valuable Vendor Award in EMEA during Pax8’s 2026 Beyond conference. The awards program recognizes vendors that have a significant impact on the channel ecosystem through strategic partnerships, enhanced engagement, and strong dedication to partners.",
